# compiler_graph FILE-LEVEL SUMMARIES (task 73, log_181) — TRACKED, by
# negation of the graph_<lang>*.json rule above.  These are what the
# dashboard's pane 4 actually reads: the whole graphs (608 MB for four) and
# the coverage join (515 MB) are ignored above and are not in a clone, so a
# clone with no summaries has no pane 4 at all.  Each is small enough to
# track (41 KB to 3.3 MB).  Regenerate them with:
#   /tmp/reconnect_venv/bin/python3 Research/compiler_graph/graph_files_build.py \
#       go rust swift cpp
#   /tmp/reconnect_venv/bin/python3 Research/compiler_graph/coverage_files_build.py
!Research/compiler_graph/graph_go_files.json
!Research/compiler_graph/graph_cpp_files.json
!Research/compiler_graph/graph_rust_files.json
!Research/compiler_graph/graph_swift_files.json
!Research/compiler_graph/graph_go_defs.json
!Research/compiler_graph/graph_cpp_defs.json
!Research/compiler_graph/graph_rust_defs.json
!Research/compiler_graph/graph_swift_defs.json

